<title>PHILIPPINES: Selecta Dairy Q1 net 12.094 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Selecta Dairy Q1 net 12.094 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Selecta Dairy Products Inc, the dairy products unit of RFM Corp said on Tuesday it made an after-tax profit of 12.094 million pesos in the first quarter ending September 30.  </p>
<p>The first quarter profit is a turnaround from a net loss of 4.7 million pesos in the same period last year.</p>
<p>The company said it churned out net sales of 336.292 million pesos for the first quarter, yielding income from operations of 17.378 million pesos.</p>
<p>For the recent fiscal year ended June 30, the company registered an audited net profit of 30.22 million pesos.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
